    <selectionEntry name="Ethereal Honour Guard" id="910d-ec84-d003-021a" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" publicationId="24a0-49b6-pubN91148" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
      </costs>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Swift Redeployment" id="d452-d9ae-a90f-884e" hidden="false" publicationId="24a0-49b6-pubN91148">
          <description>At the start of your movement phase, pick one unit from this Formation that is within 12&quot; of its Ethereal. Now choose a single model in the unit you picked to be the lynchpin around which the rest of the unit will reform; remove all other models in the unit from the battlefield (do not remove the DS8 Tactical Support Turret if there is one) and immediately set them up again within 3&quot; of the lynchpin. The unit does not count as moving; it may move normally in the same movement phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Strike Team - 1 required" id="5d3e-a571-5560-ff7e" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="e7f2-aa84-1464-aa33" hidden="false" import="true">
