            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the Fight sub-phase at the Initiative 10 step, this item inflicts D6 S4 AP- hits on each enemy unit that completed a charge against the bearer, or his unit, this turn.</characteristic>
