          <description>As long as at least one model from this Formation is still alive and on the battlefield, all friendly units with the Tau Empire Faction have the Subborn special rule.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Unbreakable Bonds of Comradeship" id="fe3d-4a6f-528a-c4a9" hidden="false">
          <description>Units from this Formation that have the Supporting Fire special rule can provide Supporting Fire to any other model in this Formation if they are within 24&quot; of each other, rather than 6&quot;.</description>
